llion Tokens\n\n\ud83d\udc8e Total Potential Rewards: 31,000,000,000 Muse Tokens!\n\n\ud83d\udccc How to Claim Your First Billion:\n\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Visit https://t.co/KfcH9zFZyj\n\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Create your Muse account.\n\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Go to Settings \u2192 General \u2192 Redeem Invite Code.\n\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 Enter: 4LYLFR\n\n5\ufe0f\u20e3 Claim your bonus and share your own referral code!\n\n\u23f0 IMPORTANT: You must redeem the invitation code within 48 hours of joining.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Whether you\u2019re exploring AI agents, experimenting with automation, or just love testing new AI tools, this is a great opportunity to get extra usage credits.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf INVITE CODE: 4LYLFR\n\nThe 31B total is the maximum potential reward from one code redemption plus 30 successful referrals, subject to Muse\u2019s current rules.\n\nLet\u2019s help each other unlock more AI tokens! \ud83d\ude80\n\n#MetaMuse #MuseAI #AI #FreeTokens #AIAgents #claude"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\ude80 How to Get Up to 31 BILLION FREE Tokens on Meta Muse!\n\nYes, you read that right. Meta Muse is offering a referral reward that could give you access to billions of extra AI tokens.\n\nAnd the best part? You don\u2019t need a paid subscription to participate!\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Here\u2019s How You Can https://t.co/2wi7W9X3pQ", "url": "https://x.com/StrattonEd39526/status/2116877664032362784"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116877608621383680"]}, "author_id": "866148566", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:58:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116877624756871664"], "id": "2116877624756871664", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 760, "start": 755, "tag": "Meta"}, {"end": 766, "start": 761, "tag": "Muse"}, {"end": 777, "start": 767, "tag": "AIPrivacy"}, {"end": 784, "start": 778, "tag": "Rumor"}], "mentions": [{"end": 532, "id": "866148566", "start": 525, 